          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પડાવ (paḍāv) seems to be built on પડવું, to fall, here to stop and lie down for the night; CDIAL lists that verb under Sanskrit pátati, \"falls\" (CDIAL 7722), but gives no form for પડાવ itself, so the link is hedged."
